You did have one conduct -- artifact wishless.  And as a tourist, too!
Nicely done.

Also, one note for next time:  Gems can be worth a lot of points, up to
4500 for a dilithium crystal, and it's about 10k or so for each of the
invocation artifacts (bell, book, and candelabrum).  The artifacts are
10 weight each, and gems are only 1 weight each, so they're nice
score-boosters -- especially the gems, since they can go in a BoH.
Just collecting all the gems you see in the dungeon can get you another
half-million points or so, and you could afford to carry them at the
expense of a few of your slightly redundant wands of digging (Not like
I didn't come overprepared my first trip to the planes, either -- it's
better than being underprepared!)

Have a nice day -- better yet, have a nice week basking in the glow of
your ascension. :)



